    "summary": "In your Shooting phase, spend 1 CP on one PROSECUTORS unit of yours that has just shot. Pick an enemy unit hit by at least one of those attacks; until your next turn begins, and only while your unit remains on the battlefield, the chosen enemy unit counts as prosecuted. Attacks by ANATHEMA PSYKANA models against a prosecuted unit improve their AP by 1, and while a prosecuted unit is PSYKER or Battle-shocked, attacks made by its models take −1 to the Hit roll.",
